    "详情页": "Detail page",
    "点击 Task ID 进入详情页，上方是任务的基本信息，下方按标签页查看执行情况。Steps 一开始就有；任务开始建立 LP 后会多出 LP Setup 标签。": "Click a Task ID to open the detail page. The basic task information is at the top, and the execution details are in tabs below. Steps is always there; once LP creation starts, an LP Setup tab appears.",
    "Steps：看每个步骤走到哪里": "Steps: see how far each step has gone",
    "每个步骤有独立的 Status 和 Action Progress，步骤按 Sequence 顺序排列。想知道一张任务卡在哪个动作，先看这里。": "Each step has its own Status and Action Progress, listed in Sequence order. To find out which action a task is stuck on, look here first.",
    "LP Setup：核对实际收了什么": "LP Setup: check what was actually received",
    "记录这张任务实际建立的 LP，包括 LP 所在位置和 LP 类型，以及每个 SKU 的数量、批次和保质期。收货后对账或追溯某个 LP 的来源，从这里查。": "Records the LPs actually created by this task, including each LP's location and type, plus the quantity, lot and shelf life of every SKU. Use it to reconcile after receiving or to trace where an LP came from.",
    "点击 Task ID 进入详情页，包含三个标签页。": "Click a Task ID to open the detail page, which has three tabs.",
    "Basic Info：确认这张退库任务的来由": "Basic Info: see why this put back task exists",
    "显示任务对应的订单、退库类型、状态和指派人。想知道为什么会产生这张任务，先看 Put Back Type。": "Shows the order, put back type, status and assignee of the task. To learn why the task was created, check Put Back Type first.",
    "Task Steps：确认执行到哪一步": "Task Steps: see which step it has reached",
    "显示 Put Back 步骤的状态和指派人。": "Shows the status and assignee of the Put Back step.",
    "Put Back History：确认货物退回到哪里": "Put Back History: see where the goods were returned",
    "任务执行后，每件货物的退回记录会出现在这里，包括退回的 SKU、数量，以及从哪个 LP 和库位退到了哪个 LP 和库位。这是确认货物最终去向的最直接依据。": "After the task runs, the return record of each item appears here: the SKU and quantity, and which LP and location it came from and went to. It is the most direct evidence of where the goods ended up.",
