  "每张分拣任务按来源和去向": "Each sort task is grouped by source and destination",
  "每张分拣任务包含完成数和总数，以及对应的批次号和波次号（Batch No / Wave No），来源容器、Mode 显示分拣方式（Manual / WCS Auto / Hybrid），Progress 追踪已分拣与待分拣数量": "Each sort task shows completed vs. total counts, the linked Batch No / Wave No, source container, Mode (Manual / WCS Auto / Hybrid), and a Progress bar tracking sorted vs. pending quantities",
