 "创建任务": "Create the task",
 "选择是否经过 ST（工作站）": "Choose whether to go through an ST (station)",
 "跟踪进度": "Track progress",
 "在详情页查看来源 Tote 和步骤": "Check source totes and steps on the detail page",
