 "合并任务的执行进展在这里跟踪": "Track how each consolidate task is progressing",
 "任务创建后，可以在这里查看每个合并任务是在等待、进行中还是已完成，由哪个站点和执行人处理。点击 Task ID 进入详情，查看来源 Tote 和合并过程。": "After a task is created, you can see here whether each consolidate task is waiting, in progress or done, and which station and assignee handle it. Click a Task ID to open the detail page with the source totes and the consolidation steps.",
 "放大创建页截图": "Enlarge the add page",
