 "创建合并任务": "Create a consolidate task",
 "先用 Customer、SKU、Fill Rate (%)、SKU Count、Total Qty、Single Item Qty、Lot No 找出候选 Tote。Fill Rate 越低表示越空。": "Find candidate totes with Customer, SKU, Fill Rate (%), SKU Count, Total Qty, Single Item Qty and Lot No. A lower Fill Rate means an emptier tote.",
 "勾选搜索结果后加入清单，清单里可以移除不需要的 Tote。": "Add ticked results to the list; any tote you do not need can be removed from it.",
