 "Task ID、状态、客户、目标库位、开始与结束时间、创建人。": "Task ID, status, customer, to location, start and end time, creator.",
 "列出参与合并的 Tote、所在库位和 LP ID，数量显示在标题里。": "Lists the totes being merged with their location and LP ID; the count is shown in the heading.",
 "显示 CONSOLIDATE 步骤的状态和 Action Progress（已完成动作数 / 总数）。": "Shows the CONSOLIDATE step status and Action Progress (completed / total).",
 "记录每次合并的明细，用来确认货搬到了哪个 Tote。": "Records each merge so you can confirm which tote the stock moved to.",
 "把分散在多个 Tote 的库存合并，腾出空容器": "Merge stock from several totes to free empty containers",
 "Consolidate Task 用于 AGV 自动化仓：把同一客户、库存状态为 OPEN 的库存集中到更少的 Tote，SKU 不要求相同。": "Consolidate Task is for AGV warehouses: it gathers the same customer's OPEN stock into fewer totes, and the SKUs need not match.",
 "订单要的是套件，需要先把组件装配起来": "An order needs a kit, so its components must be assembled first",
 "出库订单里含有 Is Kitting 商品时，系统会生成 Assembly Task；管理员也可以在 Create 页面手动建一个。操作员按 BOM 取出各组件完成组装，完成后的套件继续走出库流程。只有配置了 Kitting 商品的客户才会用到。": "When an outbound order contains an Is Kitting item an Assembly Task is generated, and a manager can also create one on the Create page. Operators pick components per the BOM and assemble them, and the finished kit continues through outbound. Only customers with Kitting items configured use it.",
 "放大 Assembly Task 列表截图": "Enlarge Assembly Task list screenshot",
