 "先选客户。未选客户时 Add Item 不能点。": "Choose the customer first; Add Item stays disabled until one is selected.",
 "点击 Add Item，在 Search kit item 中搜索套件商品并填写 Qty，Action 列可移除该行。": "Click Add Item, search the kit item in Search kit item and enter Qty; the Action column removes a row.",
 "提交后生成 Assembly Task；Cancel 返回列表。": "Submit creates the Assembly Task; Cancel returns to the list.",
 "按 BOM 把组件装配成套件，再继续出库": "Assemble components into a kit by BOM, then continue outbound",
 "Assembly Task 用在 Kitting 场景：组件装配完成后，套件作为一个整体继续出库。": "Assembly Task serves Kitting: once components are assembled, the kit moves on to outbound as a whole.",
 "一批拣好的货要按订单分拣": "A batch of picked goods must be sorted back to orders",
 "批量拣货（Batch / Wave）把多个订单的货一起拣出来，之后需要按订单拆开。Sort Task 记录这一步，列表里能看到它来自哪个批次（Batch No）、哪个波次（Wave No）、关联哪条 Pick Task，以及按哪种模式（Manual、WCS Auto、Hybrid）分拣。": "Batch or wave picking collects goods for several orders at once, and they then have to be split by order. Sort Task records that step; the list shows its Batch No, Wave No, the related Pick Task and the sort mode (Manual, WCS Auto or Hybrid).",
