 "Sort Task · 列表": "Sort Task · List",
 "分拣任务按批次跟踪进度": "Track sort tasks by batch",
 "每条分拣任务都关联到所属批次和拣货任务，用来跟踪这批订单的分拣进度。": "Each sort task is linked to its batch and pick task, so you can follow how far the sorting of that batch of orders has progressed.",
 "把批量拣出的货按订单分拣": "Sort batch-picked goods back to orders",
 "Sort Task 对应批量拣货之后的分拣步骤，用来查看分拣任务的批次、模式和状态。": "Sort Task covers the sorting step after batch picking and shows each task's batch, mode and status.",
 "怀疑某批库存与系统不符，叫容器到工作站核对": "Stock may not match the system, so containers are called to a station to be checked",
 "Inventory Check Task 适用于自动化仓：管理员在 Add 页面用筛选条件圈定要核对的库存，比如某个客户的商品、填充率偏低的容器，或很久没被拣过的容器。创建任务后，系统把对应容器呼叫到工作站，由人核对实物和系统库存是否一致。": "Inventory Check Task is for automated warehouses. On the Add page, the administrator uses the filters to narrow down the stock to check, for example one customer's goods, containers with a low fill rate, or containers that have not been picked for a long time. After the task is created, the system calls those containers to a workstation, where an operator checks whether the physical stock matches the system.",
 "放大 Inventory Check Task 列表截图": "Enlarge Inventory Check Task list screenshot",
 "Inventory Check Task 列表截图": "Inventory Check Task list screenshot",
 "Inventory Check Task · 列表": "Inventory Check Task · List",
 "查看每个盘点核对任务的进展": "Check the progress of each inventory check task",
 "每条记录对应一个需要核对的容器，Station 表示容器被呼叫到的工作站。状态变为完成后，说明该容器的实物与系统库存已核对完毕。": "Each record is one container that needs checking, and Station is the workstation it is called to. Once the status shows completed, the physical stock and system inventory of that container have been checked.",
