 "Search 查出符合条件的库存，Reset 清空条件。": "Search finds matching stock and Reset clears the conditions.",
 "叫容器到工作站，核对实物与系统库存": "Call containers to a station to check physical against system stock",
 "Inventory Check Task 用来确认自动化仓里的实物是否与系统库存一致。": "Inventory Check Task confirms whether physical stock in an automated warehouse matches the system.",
 "任务状态或库存位置不对，要回溯每一步动作": "A task status or stock location looks wrong and each action must be traced",
 "Task Action 是所有任务类型的动作明细。管理员遇到任务卡住、库存位置和预期不一致时，可以按 Task ID、Action ID 或 Task Type 找到对应动作，看它从哪个库位到哪个库位、数量多少、有没有发给 WCS，以及 WCS 的处理状态。": "Task Action holds the action detail for every task type. When a task is stuck or a stock location is not as expected, find the action by Task ID, Action ID or Task Type and see which location it moved from and to, the quantity, whether it was sent to WCS and the WCS status.",
 "放大 Task Action 列表左半部分": "Enlarge Task Action list, left half",
