 "Task Action 列表右半部分截图": "Task Action list, right half",
 "Task Action · 列表": "Task Action · List",
 "每个具体动作是否成功交给 WCS，在这里确认": "Confirm here whether each action was handed to WCS successfully",
 "每条记录是任务拆出来的一个具体动作，Send To WCS 与 WCS Status 用来判断它有没有成功交给 WCS，Status 为 Failed 的动作需要优先排查。Task Type 覆盖收货、上架、拣货、盘点、装车等十类任务。表格较宽，需要左右滚动，下面分成左右两段展示。每行的 Detail 可查看动作详情。": "Each record is one concrete action split out of a task. Send To WCS and WCS Status tell you whether it was handed to WCS successfully, and actions with a Status of Failed should be checked first. Task Type covers ten kinds of tasks, including receive, put away, pick, cycle count and loading. The table is wide and needs horizontal scrolling, so it is shown below in a left half and a right half. Use Detail on a row to see the action details.",
 "入口": "Entry",
 "列表上方的 WCS Send Records 按钮会跳到 WCS Send Log 页面。": "The WCS Send Records button above the list jumps to the WCS Send Log page.",
 "任务执行动作的明细，排查状态与库存差异": "Action detail behind every task, for tracing status and stock differences",
 "Task Action 覆盖所有任务类型，主要用于排查任务状态异常和库存位置不一致。": "Task Action covers all task types and is mainly used to trace abnormal task status and stock location differences.",
 "设备没有动，要确认指令有没有成功发给 WCS": "A device is not moving and you need to confirm the instruction reached WCS",
 "系统每次向 WCS 发出指令都会留一条记录。设备不动或任务停在发送环节时，可以按 Action ID 或 Result 找到对应记录，看发送是否成功、WCS 返回的 Job ID 和 HTTP 状态；失败的记录可以用行末的 Retry 重新发送。": "Every instruction the system sends to WCS leaves a record. When a device is idle or a task stalls at sending, find the record by Action ID or Result and check whether it succeeded, the Job ID returned by WCS and the HTTP status; a failed record can be resent with Retry at the end of the row.",
 "放大 WCS Send Log 截图": "Enlarge WCS Send Log screenshot",
 "WCS Send Log 列表截图（筛选 Result = Failed）": "WCS Send Log list filtered to Result = Failed",
 "WCS Send Log · 列表": "WCS Send Log · List",
 "发送失败的记录在这里排查与重发": "Investigate and resend failed sends here",
 "把 Result 筛选为 Failed，就能快速找到下发失败的记录。Result 是开关样式，开启表示成功。点行首箭头可展开本次发送的请求头与请求内容，结合 HTTP Status 和 WCS Job ID 判断 WCS 是否收到。Retry 会重新向 WCS 发送，请确认原因已处理后再点。": "Filter Result by Failed to find sends that did not go through quickly. Result is shown as a switch, and on means success. Click the arrow at the start of a row to expand the request headers and body of that send, and use HTTP Status and WCS Job ID to judge whether WCS received it. Retry sends the request to WCS again, so only use it after the cause has been fixed.",
